
                  zelda64 -- Nintendo 64 Zelda ROM utilities

Purpose

    zelda64 is a library and program for compressing, decompressing, extracting
    and manipulating Nintendo 64 Zelda ROMs.

Origin

    The zelda64 project was started in 2026 to create a modern and well-tested
    ROM compressor and decompressor for the Ocarina of Time Randomizer. The
    project also serves as the main consumer of libyaz0 which is used for the
    compression and decompression of ROMs.

